POS-DGFY - Global Location SwitchingPlan version1.0Revision date2026-09-27Plan statusNOT EXECUTION READYPlanning depthLevel 4 - critical multi-tenant, financial, inventory, authorization, and migration changePurpose. This editable document consolidates the complete Location Switching planning package into one Word document. It defines the recommended global location context, the existing Shift-controlled transition, module behavior, permissions, data ownership, verification, rollout, recovery, and execution handoff.
Recommended approach
Use a visible Current Location entry point in the global header and mobile sidebar. Route operating-location changes through the existing Shift workflow, and keep viewing-location access read-only. Do not implement a second unrestricted switching path.Plan contents
