PLAN-03  Target Architecture and Data Model
Target context model
LocationContext = {
tenantId,
operatingLocationId,
viewingLocationId,
terminalId,
activeShiftId,
queueLocationScopeId,
contextVersion,
transitionState
}
The frontend may display and coordinate this context, but the backend remains authoritative for permissions, terminal binding, shift
ownership, location grants, and transaction location.
