PLAN-04  Scope Requirements and Business Rules
In scope
Global location entry point and context labels.
Operating-location switching through the existing Shift workflow.
Location-aware Items, stock, Add Item, sales, parked sales, queue, reports, shifts, settings, vouchers, price lists, affiliates, and
audit.
Server-side permissions, concurrency, idempotency, offline safety, testing, rollout, observability, and recovery.
Out of scope
GPS, Wi-Fi, IP, or automatic physical branch detection.
Automatic conflict takeover or silent shift reassignment.
Duplicate branch catalogs or destructive schema replacement.
New offline login or branch transfer behavior not already supported by the contract.
