Operating switch workflow
Open Current Location
-> Run cart, payment, offline, permission, and terminal preflight
-> Select authorized destination location and terminal
-> Enter counted closing cash, opening float, reason, and notes
-> Submit idempotent shift transition
-> Refresh context and all dependent modules
-> Confirm destination operating context
