First eligible implementation move
Complete Phase 354 discovery and contract reconciliation in a clean dedicated worktree. Do not implement the global selector or
database changes before the scope matrix, permission matrix, and module ownership audit are approved.
Continuous phase sequence
Use the existing governed sequence: Phase 354 contract/discovery, Phase 355 backend enforcement, Phase 356 POS UI/context
integration, and Phase 357 hardening and acceptance. Reconcile the main phase ledger before recording new entries.
Final decision
PLAN STATUS: NOT EXECUTION READY: The plan is complete as a planning artifact, but implementation must wait for
the documented discovery gates. This is intentional and protects inventory, financial history, authorization boundaries,
and rollback safety.
